a,,b : records 2  first text a | middle empty | last text b
the numbers row: number 1 | number -2 | number 3
quoted comma is one field: records 1  field 0 text one,two  field 1 text he said "hi"
quoted digits stay text, bare digits do not: text 42 | number 42
a trailing line ending adds no record: 2  and a file with no ending still counts its last: 1
round trip of a,,b : a,,b
1,-2,3

round trip of the quoted row: "one,two","he said ""hi""","42",42

003 is not a round trip: it came back as number 3
an empty text writes as nothing: set yes  kind before write text  row now ,y
